    },
    {
      "text": "[14:23]  As for those who believed and led a righteous life, they were admitted into gardens with flowing streams. They abide therein forever, in accordance with the will of their Lord. Their greeting therein is: \"Peace.\"",
      "start": 187.38,
      "end": 199.36,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
