          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " her.",
          "start": 370.3,
          "end": 370.56,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, we ended up half the kids are believers and half are disbelievers.",
