          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Psalms.",
          "start": 3117.47,
          "end": 3117.73,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Which is true, but he wrote it with God's inspiration.",
