        },
        {
          "word": " inspiration.",
          "start": 3121.19,
          "end": 3121.49,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "God... we're told here God gave David the Psalms, because he deserved it.",
