        },
        {
          "word": " wisdom.",
          "start": 3561.41,
          "end": 3561.61,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hadith is not revealed from God. It's revealed from Satan.",
