          "end": 3935.31,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " divorce?",
          "start": 3935.31,
          "end": 3935.56,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Huh? A man: Did they divorce?",
