        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, it applies to the creatures, not to the Creator.",
      "start": 4895.11,
      "end": 4901.45,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " it",
          "start": 4895.11,
