          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " as",
          "start": 4901.61,
          "end": 4901.79,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " God",
          "start": 4901.79,
          "end": 4901.79,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 4909.53,
          "end": 4909.87,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " concerned,",
          "start": 4909.87,
          "end": 4910.63,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " there",
          "start": 4911.35,
          "end": 4911.35,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 4911.35,
          "end": 4911.63,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " no",
          "start": 4911.75,
          "end": 4911.87,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " time.",
          "start": 4911.87,
          "end": 4911.97,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Therefore,",
          "start": 4913.15,
          "end": 4913.23,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Therefore, there is no sequence.",
      "start": 4913.53,
      "end": 4918.69,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " there",
          "start": 4913.53,
          "end": 4913.61,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 4913.61,
          "end": 4915.51,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " no",
          "start": 4915.51,
          "end": 4915.51,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " sequence.",
          "start": 4917.79,
          "end": 4918.67,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " It",
          "start": 4918.67,
          "end": 4918.69,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It means that the people who will be born a hundred years from now,",
