          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " yet?",
          "start": 4936.89,
          "end": 4936.99,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Yes.",
          "start": 4940.49,
          "end": 4940.99,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. But they are not in existence yet.",
