          "end": 4946.65,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " They",
          "start": 4947.23,
          "end": 4947.33,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They will be here a hundred years from now.",
