          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " As",
          "start": 4951.99,
          "end": 4951.99,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As far as we're concerned. A man: I mean, who said that past, future, and past and present and future do not exist at the same time?",
