          "end": 5019.23,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Because",
          "start": 5019.23,
          "end": 5019.23,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because when people ask us, we should have an answer for that.",
      "start": 5019.23,
      "end": 5021.39,
      "speaker": "Parivash",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " when",
