        },
        {
          "word": " God",
          "start": 5326.51,
          "end": 5326.51,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "God uses the same thing for Jesus. He said (19:21) \u0648\u064e\u0631\u064e\u062d\u0652\u0645\u064e\u0629\u064b\u06ed \u0645\u0651\u0650\u0646\u0651\u064e\u0627",
