          "start": 5327.33,
          "end": 5327.33,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0648\u064e\u0631\u064e\u062d\u0652\u0645\u064e\u0629\u064b\u06ed",
          "start": 5327.33,
          "end": 5327.33,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0645\u0651\u0650\u0646\u0651\u064e\u0627",
          "start": 5327.33,
          "end": 5327.55,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " When",
          "start": 5327.57,
          "end": 5327.85,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When they say,  (21:107) \u0648\u064e\u0645\u064e\u0627\u0653 \u0623\u064e\u0631\u0652\u0633\u064e\u0644\u0652\u0646\u064e\u0640\u0670\u0643\u064e \u0625\u0650\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0627 \u0631\u064e\u062d\u0652\u0645\u064e\u0629\u064b\u06ed \u0644\u0651\u0650\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0640\u0670\u0644\u064e\u0645\u0650\u064a\u0646\u064e we sent you as a mercy to the people,",
      "start": 5327.87,
      "end": 5329.66,
